<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Evander lists in Brussels.</title>
<headline>Evander lists in Brussels.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evander Gold Mines Ltd listed on the Brussels stock exchange on Monday, mine managers Gengold Ltd said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27-11 482-1003</p>
</text>
